#: ../../source/guide/quickstart.md:1 521e0f1948724da3858ee9257342d26d
msgid "快速上手"
msgstr "Quick Start"

#: ../../source/guide/quickstart.md:3 edef4dbb609540c1966ba468e53714b3
msgid "安装"
msgstr "Installation"

#: ../../source/guide/quickstart.md:5 4cb631c40ec6426bb4ee70e0504bd0a5
msgid "桌面应用（Windows）"
msgstr "Desktop application (Windows)"

#: ../../source/guide/quickstart.md:7 553f1bd23dd241d2981878a93706aed4
msgid ""
"从 [GitHub Releases](https://github.com/cislunarspace/transfer-orbit-"
"design/releases) 下载 `transfer-orbit-design_<版本>_x64-setup.exe`，双击安装（NSIS "
"安装器， 免管理员权限，安装到当前用户目录）。安装包自带 e2m2e 运行时与全套 SPICE 内核（含行星历），开箱即用。另有 Linux "
"AppImage / deb 包与桌面端自动更新。"
msgstr "Download `transfer-orbit-design_<version>_x64-setup.exe` from [GitHub Releases](https://github.com/cislunarspace/transfer-orbit-design/releases) and double-click to install (NSIS installer; per-user, no administrator rights). The installer bundles the e2m2e runtime and the full SPICE kernel set including planetary ephemerides — ready out of the box. Linux AppImage / deb packages and desktop auto-update are also available."

#: ../../source/guide/quickstart.md:12 1b02b2498d184d90ab6af31008932dbf
msgid "开发环境"
msgstr "Development environment"

#: ../../source/guide/quickstart.md:14 bbe8d89eb20c4fd8afa083eda60dc307
msgid "要求 Python >= 3.13、Node.js >= 20、Rust 稳定版工具链："
msgstr "Requires Python >= 3.13, Node.js >= 20 and a stable Rust toolchain:"

#: ../../source/guide/quickstart.md:22 14f172f759594db0bfdd82579421039e
#, python-brace-format
msgid "SPICE 内核经 Git LFS 随仓库分发，克隆后位于 `kernels/`；星历类工具开箱即用 （内核说明见 {doc}`kernels`）。"
msgstr "SPICE kernels ship with the repository via Git LFS (`kernels/` after cloning); ephemeris tools work out of the box (see {doc}`kernels`)."

#: ../../source/guide/quickstart.md:25 80b09ae33ac7452fa66d0b0f7ec06da4
msgid "界面速览"
msgstr "Interface at a Glance"

#: ../../source/guide/quickstart.md:27 fdf59a128a664feb8e68a6997932786f
msgid "三栏布局，右侧附可折叠的助手边栏："
msgstr "Three columns, plus a collapsible assistant sidebar on the right:"

#: ../../source/guide/quickstart.md:29 2ffbf7ec01c34462bcaddb6bbdeaaaa8
msgid "**左栏**：项目/轨道库页签 + 语言切换。项目页签列出当前会话与库中 产物；轨道库页签打开即全库加载，附多维过滤栏。"
msgstr "**Left column**: \"Project\" / \"Catalog\" tabs + language switcher. The Project tab lists session and library products; the Catalog tab loads the whole library on open and carries a multi-dimensional filter bar."

#: ../../source/guide/quickstart.md:31 3ca1739760cc4986bafb4fe4f57bc17c
msgid ""
"**中栏**：工具下拉 + 参数面板。八个工具接通：轨道族生成、任务 轨道设计、参数空间扫描、轨道保持、轨道预报、转移轨道设计、时空 "
"坐标转换、分区边界（轨道稳定性因上游 placeholder 暂不接入）。"
msgstr "**Middle column**: tool dropdown + parameter panel. Eight tools are wired: orbit family generation, orbit design, parameter sweep, station keeping, orbit propagation, transfer design, spacetime transform, and spatiography boundaries (stability analysis stays out while upstream marks it a placeholder)."

#: ../../source/guide/quickstart.md:34 54f5521dd666434fb5a857e3495bfcea
msgid ""
"**右栏**：Three.js 画布（详见 {doc}`visualization`），停靠在画布上方的 "
"工具栏提供投影/中心切换、适配与录制导出、图表设置，左下角状态行显示 运行进度。"
msgstr "**Right column**: the Three.js canvas (see {doc}`visualization`); a toolbar docked above it provides projection/center switching, fit, animation export and chart settings; a status line at the bottom left shows run progress."

#: ../../source/guide/quickstart.md:37 25d30392e9cb4c7ab973242712f9a8d7
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**助手边栏**：配置模型服务后可对话式发起计算（详见 {doc}`gui` 的 AI 助手一节）。"
msgstr "**Assistant sidebar**: once a model service is configured, computations can be driven conversationally (see the AI Assistant section of {doc}`gui`)."

#: ../../source/guide/quickstart.md:40 99a52fa0bc6546f58e2f897818798078
msgid "生成一族轨道"
msgstr "Generate an Orbit Family"

#: ../../source/guide/quickstart.md:42 9ba80c8be91848d898485d7364c6d540
msgid "中栏选族类型：Halo / NRHO / Axial / Lissajous / SPO / LPO / Horseshoe / DRO。"
msgstr ""
"Pick a family in the middle column: Halo / NRHO / Axial / Lissajous / SPO"
" / LPO / Horseshoe / DRO."

#: ../../source/guide/quickstart.md:43 e5ee15957dfc4d54a52b9369882dd742
msgid "面板按族裁剪参数（各族参数见 {doc}`tools`），改振幅上限、成员数等，点生成。"
msgstr "The panel prunes parameters per family (see {doc}`tools`); adjust the amplitude bound, member count, etc., then click \"Generate\"."

#: ../../source/guide/quickstart.md:44 f99733d0901f40aa82558d4760b3b339
#, python-brace-format
msgid "计算在 sidecar 子进程进行，左下角状态行滚动显示进度；完成后族成员轨迹 逐条出现在画布上，产物自动写入轨道库（{doc}`output`）。"
msgstr ""
"The computation runs in the sidecar process while the status line scrolls"
" progress; on completion the member trajectories appear on the canvas one"
" by one, and the product is written into the orbit library "
"({doc}`output`)."

#: ../../source/guide/quickstart.md:47 464d5f1c690440baae027fd75d4a4662
msgid "浏览轨道库"
msgstr "Browsing the Orbit Library"

#: ../../source/guide/quickstart.md:49 7d1ffec47a354818809fe017bc03fa71
msgid "切到左栏轨道库页签："
msgstr "Switch to the left \"Catalog\" tab:"

#: ../../source/guide/quickstart.md:51 c30f2df5c1e24abb99cba6ecdda2a1d3
msgid "打开即查询全库；改过滤条件（族类型、平动点、Jacobi 与振幅区间、标签）后点查询。"
msgstr "Opening it queries the whole library; adjust the filters (family type, libration point, Jacobi and amplitude ranges, tags) and click \"Query\"."

#: ../../source/guide/quickstart.md:52 dac7c0d17075464d9730e9d2cc275cc8
msgid "点击任一记录，其轨迹钉入固定层与结果层同屏显示；多选可同屏叠加多条， 便于与新生成的族对比。"
msgstr "Click any record to pin its trajectories into the pinned layer alongside the result layer; multi-select overlays several records at once — handy for comparing against a freshly generated family."

#: ../../source/guide/quickstart.md:55 042d25eb7be44fda818eb0eacbb60767
msgid "下一步"
msgstr "Next Steps"

#: ../../source/guide/quickstart.md:57 6e8e16b28b0a43cabbb623c4cde10b2d
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"其余计算工具（轨道设计、轨道保持、轨道预报、转移设计、时空坐标转换）的 界面已接通，参数与产物说明见 {doc}`tools`；AI "
"助手的配置与使用见 {doc}`gui`；需要脚本化工作流时可用 [e2m2e "
"CLI](https://cislunarspace.github.io/e2m2e/)。"
msgstr "The remaining computational tools (orbit design, station keeping, orbit propagation, transfer design, spacetime transform) are wired up; see {doc}`tools` for parameters and products, and {doc}`gui` for the AI assistant. For scripted workflows, use the [e2m2e CLI](https://cislunarspace.github.io/e2m2e/)."

